(text "TUB 1 PRE-REGULATOR BOARD (bom 17o) - SEPARATE PCB: all symbols here are on_board=no. One 6 VAC / 20 VA R-core transformer per channel - THT, SOLDERED ON THIS BOARD (ACENTRY sheet); secondaries land directly on the bridge diodes (AC6_x1/AC6_x2 globals). Branches are NEVER paralleled: each TPS7A4501 output is an independent rail. V4P3_LA->V33CLK+P5A_L, V4P3_LB->V33D+P5A_R, V4P3_LC->V33FF_L (U705, FF dual-mono split), V4P3_RA->V33FF_R, V4P3_RB->V33RLY. J703 mates main-board J603 (Conn2 north), J704 mates J604 (Conn3 south) through the SEAR-40 interposers." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 17.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "20944b49-926c-450d-b2b6-eced317e3c0d"))
(text "Reservoir sizing (per transformer, 2 A DC worst): 3 x 10,000 uF/16 V high-ripple 105 C = 30 mF; ~1 V pp ripple at 50 Hz/-10% line -> trough ~5.8 V vs the 4.8 V floor (4.3 V out + 0.5 V TPS7A4501 dropout budget). P16A/N16A/V8P3 stages are DRAWN below (bottom strip, 2026-10-28 - 115 V mains ruling). Mains fuse/switch/inlet filter live in the chassis DD12 PEM (see ACENTRY); PE bond at the module." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 20.000 24.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "02ac9ed6-3b98-4f39-865e-18e0cbf76171"))
(symbol (lib_id "Device:D_Schottky") (at 74.930 54.610 0) (unit 1) (exclude_from_sim no) (in_bom yes) (on_board no) (dnp no) (uuid "8fd1ecca-4552-4c76-ba9b-cad3bd06ee86") (property "Reference" "D7701" (at 77.930 53.310 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Value" "STPS10L60D" (at 77.930 55.910 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left))) (property "Footprint" "Package_TO_SOT_THT:TO-220-2_Vertical" (at 74.930 54.610 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Datasheet" "" (at 74.930 54.610 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "Description" "ST 60 V/10 A low-Vf Schottky bridge leg, TO-220AC (Vf ~0.48 V typ @10 A/25 C; bom 17n: low-Vf silicon chosen over 650 V SiC ~1.5 V/diode) ** VERIFY Vf at the actual capacitor-charge pulse current + IFSM **" (at 74.930 54.610 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (property "MPN" "STPS10L60D" (at 74.930 54.610 0) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))) (pin "1" (uuid "040d315b-c6f4-44b6-9132-90a375fdde0f")) (pin "2" (uuid "79b716b5-5893-45a4-9a70-0e84dd2ea820")) (instances (project "bfdac_analog" (path "/3be49b0a-319c-46ee-95a9-e5b753dc9c3b/bc4be8dd-f93f-408d-9c52-d7086e46c89b" (reference "D7701") (unit 1)))))
