(text "J7703/J7704 = pre-reg-board SEAF-40 mates (the SEAR-40-30.0-06-85 interposers plug these to main-board J603/J604). Pad map mirrors the main board: A branches on pads 7/9-11, B branches on pads 15-18, LC branch on pads 23-26 (J703 only), shared rails on 1/3/5 (+41/43/45)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 560.000 40.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "8babd318-aac6-4b9e-902c-5422cb21e550"))
(text "J7705 = pre-reg-board SEAF-40 mate to Conn1/J506 (user ruling 2026-11-03: the pre-reg board mates ALL THREE main-board SEAFs through SEAR-40 interposers; SEAF sockets on both boards, male pins live on the riser/interposer card).  Full 240-pad mirror of docs/SEAF_PIN_ASSIGNMENTS.md: V12SOM bank (30 pads) is SOURCED on this assembly (LRS-200-12 -> J931/J932 harness on the acentry section); V33_IF_IN source is TBD on this board; row-A AP_* signals, SOM_PG, and VAP_IO/GND_AP continue to the application-processor section - its physical interconnect is undecided (AP processor path not yet picked), so the row-A nets land here as pass-through for now." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 960.000 40.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "21f40983-7923-4481-9b0c-7af763ac128d"))
(text "TEST POINTS: reservoirs / AC secondaries / all eight regulator outputs on hook pads; GND below." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 560.000 160.000 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "bfc6292f-a2a3-4c58-a99a-c68d81115416"))
